WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:11.344
Maganin Kashe Ƙwayoyin Cuta, Sanitiser, Rubutun Kaya da Bunƙasa Kasuwanci. Wannan shi ne babi na 5, babi na ƙarshe na kwas ɗin.

2
00:00:11.758 --> 00:00:19.369
Waɗannan kaya suna kare lafiya, don haka dokokinsu sun fi tsauri. Bari mu yi su daidai.

3
00:00:20.369 --> 00:00:32.796
Ki kalli yadda ake fesa wannan teburi a goge shi da sabulu tukuna. Datti da maiko suna kare ƙwayoyin cuta kuma suna cinye maganin.

4
00:00:33.243 --> 00:00:41.068
Don haka tsarin kullum shi ne: a fara wankewa, a kurkura, sannan a kashe ƙwayoyin cuta.

5
00:00:42.068 --> 00:00:51.287
Kafin ki tsarma bilicin, ki saka safar hannu da kariyar ido. Ki yi amfani da ruwan sanyi a wurin da iska ke shiga.

6
00:00:52.287 --> 00:01:04.645
Waɗannan kofuna suna farawa daga bilicin mai ƙarfi zuwa tsarma mai rauni. Kina lissafawa da C1 sau V1 daidai da C2 sau V2.

7
00:01:05.051 --> 00:01:29.985
Grace a Ilorin tana buƙatar 0.1% don ƙasa da 0.5% don kayan goge zubewa. Duka biyun sun ɗauki kusan mililita 286 na bilicinta na 3.5%, an dai cika su zuwa yawa daban-daban.

8
00:01:30.436 --> 00:01:37.896
Tana rubuta ƙarfi, kwanan wata da lokaci a kowane bokiti, kuma ba ta taɓa ƙara wa tsohon bokiti ba.

9
00:01:38.896 --> 00:01:47.696
Ki raba waɗannan biyun. Kada ki taɓa haɗa bilicin da asid, ammonia ko wasu magungunan wanki.

10
00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:59.912
Ki ajiye bilicin da aka tsarma a robobi masu rubutu, nesa da rana kuma nesa da yara. Ki kurkura wuraren ƙarfe bayan lokacin aikinsa.

11
00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:11.847
Ki ga yadda wurin yake zama a jike yayin da agogo ke tafiya. Wannan shi ne lokacin aiki, kuma goge shi ya bushe da wuri kuskure ne da aka saba yi.

12
00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:29.171
Quat kamar BKC, ragowar sabulu yana hana su aiki, don haka ki kurkura tukuna. Musa ya auna giram 40 na mai kauri 50% cikin kusan lita 9, sannan ya cika zuwa 10.

13
00:02:30.171 --> 00:02:53.033
Kalmomi kamar maganin kashe ƙwayoyin cuta ko yana kashe 99.9% na ƙwayoyin cuta iƙirarin lafiya ne. A Najeriya suna buƙatar rajistar NAFDAC, hukumar kula da abinci da magunguna, da gwajin tasiri.

14
00:02:53.523 --> 00:03:08.049
Har zuwa lokacin, ki sayar da gaskiya a matsayin sabulun tsabtace wuri, ki koya wa masu saye su yi amfani da magungunan da aka yi wa rajista daidai.

15
00:03:09.049 --> 00:03:23.273
Yanzu maganin goge hannu, wato sanitiser. Waɗannan kwalaben awo suna ɗauke da alcohol, hydrogen peroxide da glycerol, tsarin Hukumar Lafiya ta Duniya, WHO.

16
00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:32.952
Peroxide yana kashe ƙwayoyin spores, glycerol kuma yana kare fata. Idan kika canza tsarin, ba tsarin WHO ba ne kuma.

17
00:03:33.952 --> 00:03:44.375
Methanol guba ne ta fata da kuma idan an haɗiye shi. Ki sayi ethanol ko isopropyl alcohol mai takardar shaidar gwaji.

18
00:03:44.832 --> 00:03:56.842
Tururin alcohol yana kama wuta cikin sauƙi. Ki haɗa kusa da taga a buɗe, babu wuta, babu gas na girki, babu shan taba, babu janareta a kusa.

19
00:03:57.842 --> 00:04:12.796
Hadiza a Sakkwato ta duba ethanol ɗinta da alcoholmeter, wato mitar auna alcohol. Ya nuna 90%, ba 96% ba.

20
00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:30.625
Don haka ta auna mililita 1,778 maimakon mililita 1,667, kuma sanitiser ɗin da ta gama ya kai 80%.

21
00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:41.675
Ki cika, ki rufe, ki rubuta a kowace kwalba kashin alcohol, lambar haɗi, kwanan wata da Yana kama wuta: a nisanta daga wuta.

22
00:04:42.077 --> 00:04:50.324
Sannan ki riƙe su na awa 72 kafin a yi amfani da su. Wannan keɓewa wani ɓangare ne na tsarin.

23
00:04:51.324 --> 00:05:04.210
Kowane rubutu yana buƙatar suna, yawan abin da ke ciki, sinadarai mafi yawa a farko, yadda ake amfani, gargaɗi, wanda ya yi, lambar NAFDAC da bayanin haɗi.

24
00:05:04.654 --> 00:05:12.324
Ada a Legas ta gano bayanan wata kwalba mai tsululu cikin mintuna, saboda lamba irin wannan.

25
00:05:13.324 --> 00:05:21.458
A teburinta, Comfort a Asaba ta haɗa kashi uku na kuɗin da ta kashe ta raba da kwalabe 40.

26
00:05:21.918 --> 00:05:34.479
Kuɗin kwalabe da naɗi ya kusa kai na ruwan sabulun. Don haka tana neman famfon kwalba mai araha kafin ta ƙara farashinta.

27
00:05:34.972 --> 00:05:46.390
Ki girma mataki-mataki, kilogiram 20, sannan kilogiram 50, sannan kilogiram 100, kina gwaji a kowane mataki.

28
00:05:47.390 --> 00:06:00.658
Otal, makarantu da ofisoshi suna sake oda kowane wata. Ngozi ta yi gwaji na sati biyu, sannan ta ba da farashi daga ainihin amfani.

29
00:06:01.111 --> 00:06:18.446
Idan bashin kwana 30 ne, dole ta biya kayan kusan naira 30,800 kowane wata. Ki rubuta sharuɗɗa a takarda, kuma kada ki taɓa kai kayan da ba a yi wa rajista ba ga asibitoci.

30
00:06:19.446 --> 00:06:33.254
Yanzu ki bi darussan da ke ƙasa. Ki yi jadawalin tsarmawarki, haɗin sanitiser naki a takarda, rubutunki na kaya da takardar lissafin kuɗi, sannan ki shirya bayani ɗaya ga wata cibiya.

31
00:06:33.679 --> 00:06:37.010
Madalla da kika kammala kwas ɗin.

